---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { event } from '../data/event';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy & participation | TPSP 2026"
  description="How to apply or RSVP, the parent and guardian role, and information about photography and filming at TPSP 2026."
>
  <article class="participation wrap section">
    <a class="back-link" href="/">
      ← TPSP 2026
    </a>
    <h1>
      Privacy &<br />
      participation.
    </h1>
    <section>
      <h2>Applications and RSVPs</h2>
      <p>
        This website does not collect applications or RSVPs. Contestant
        applications are submitted through the organiser’s Google Form. Audience
        RSVPs are handled by Luma. Those services have their own privacy notices
        and may require you to sign in.
      </p>
      <p>
        This site uses locally hosted fonts and does not include analytics,
        tracking cookies or embedded registration forms.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>For parents and guardians</h2>
      <p>
        A parent or legal guardian must submit a contestant’s application.
        Review the form’s information and permission requests before sending the
        video or the student’s details. Contact the organiser if you have
        questions about access, retention, corrections or withdrawal.
      </p>
      <p>
        Student audition videos, guardian contact details and judging notes are
        not published on this website.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Photography and filming</h2>
      <p>
        Photography and filming are planned at the event, including for a
        YouTube feature. Participant and guardian permissions will be
        coordinated by the organising team.
      </p>
      <p>
        Public use of a student’s footage must follow the scope of the
        permission recorded for that student. An application or audience RSVP
        should not be treated as blanket permission to publish a student’s
        video. Ask the host about filming arrangements or any concern before
        attending.
      </p>
    </section>
    <section>
      <h2>Contact the organiser</h2>
      <p>
        TPSP is convened by {event.organiser}. For participation or privacy
        questions, email <a href={`mailto:${event.email}`}>{event.email}</a> or
        visit the{' '}
        <a href={event.rsvp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          Luma event page<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span>
        </a>{' '}
        and choose “Contact the Host”.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
